  "verdict": {
    "texte": "A good fit for disciplined traders who would rather grow a small account step by step than buy a large one outright, from a firm that publishes its pass rate, which is still rare. The trade-off is strict rules with little room for error. Look elsewhere if you want a high split from the first dollar.",
